  "contentPreview": "Task 4.1 root cause was a direct \u0060dotnet publish src/Scrinia/Scrinia.csproj -c Release -o publish\u0060 in \u0060.github/workflows/release.yml\u0060 that bypassed the manifest-driven publish.ps1/publish.sh contract. Removing that step makes the release workflow use only approved publishers for all supported RIDs and plugin expansion. Retirement and history guards were already green; protected artifacts matched exact SHA-256 values and were not rewritten. Focused combined tests passed 27/27 with 3 Windows bash",
